{
  "title": "Who Made Me a Princess",
  "slug": "who-made-me-a-princess",
  "mangaId": "722a45c0-5e55-40f2-929b-ff69b0989edb",
  "coverUrl": "https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/722a45c0-5e55-40f2-929b-ff69b0989edb/1b24d6dc-04a2-466b-a5d7-b86dde5087d3.jpg.256.jpg",
  "description": "When I opened my eyes, I had become a princess! But out of all the characters from this romance novel to be reborn into, why must it be the princess whose fate it is to die by the hands of her own blood-related father, the emperor?! If I want to live, I must never enter his sight. However…  \n\n\"Since when did this kind of scumbag start living in my castle?\"\n\nWithout a single tear to shed nor a drop of blood to spill, that cruel and cold emperor, Claude! Will I, the Princess Athanasia who was caught by him, survive?\n\n\"I… What should I do…\"\n\n---\nThe beautiful Athanasia was killed at the hands of her own biological father, Claude de Alger Obelia, the cold-blooded emperor! It’s just a silly bedtime story… until one woman wakes up to suddenly find she’s become that unfortunate princess! She needs a plan to survive her doomed fate, and time is running out. \n\nWill she go with Plan A, live as quietly as possible without being noticed by the infamous emperor? Plan B, collect enough money to escape the palace? Or will she be stuck with Plan C, sweet-talking her way into her father’s good graces?!\n\n\n---\n**Original Webtoon:** [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/51880368), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=3903318), [RidiBooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3240000001)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/series/whoprincess/1)\n* [Chinese (Simplified) / 汉语](http://kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/2991/)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/drama/princessnasi/list?title_no=1618)\n* [French / Français](http://delitoon.com/webtoon/dites-moi-princesse)\n* [German / Deutsch](https://altraverse.de/manga/athanasia-ploetzlich-prinzessin/)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://www.webtoons.com/id/fantasy/became-a-princess/list?title_no=1588)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/13034)\n* [Thai / ภาษาไทย](https://www.webtoons.com/th/fantasy/became-a-princess/list?title_no=1625)",
